**P2 follow-up — Malformed ledger discards already-detected Codex drift.**

- **FILE:LINE:** [`.claude/scripts/check-substrate-drift.py:782`](/private/var/folders/9n/hm9srl0s1nz45_p12tj61pd80000gn/T/repass-ga.TOVy5x/wt/.claude/scripts/check-substrate-drift.py:782), added by this diff; the outer exception handler at line 1228 resets the report.
